{"text":"ndaria Classic, Titan Reforged Classic, Classic Era, and Burning Crusade Classic.\n\nCompatibility handling accounts for differences between Retail and Classic clients.\n\nSome functionality may vary depending on the game version and Blizzard API restrictions.\n\nThe What The Whisper Philosophy\n\nCommunication should be simple, organized, and enjoyable.\n\nWhat The Whisper brings the convenience of modern messaging applications into the World of Warcraft experience.\n\nInstead of replacing your entire social interface with something complicated, it focuses on making private conversations more accessible, intuitive, and visually appealing.\n\nMore conversations. Less clutter. Better communication.\n\nBecause whispers shouldn't feel like 2004 anymore.\n\nCommunity & Development\n\nWhat The Whisper is actively developed with ongoing improvements, interface refinements, and community-driven feedback.\n\nHave a feature request, found a bug, or want to suggest an improvement?\n\nShare your feedback through CurseForge or join our Discord community.\n\nDeveloped by JugoBetrugoTV\n\nThank you for using What The Whisper. Stay connected across Azeroth!\n\nReview229 dependencies\nWhatTheWhisper\n2.0\nCURSEFORGEFOREVER\nRequires Review229Missing · Missing: Review229Missing\nChangelog\nNo changelog available.\nReview229 dependencies\nWhatTheWhisper\n2.0\nCURSEFORGEFOREVER\nRequires Review229Missing · Missing: Review229Missing\nRelationships\nRequired\nFrom the addon's own files; it doesn't load without them\nReview229Missing\nMISSING","tabs":[{"tag":"DIV","text":"Description","cls":""},{"tag":"DIV","text":"Relationships","cls":""}]}
